# Implementation Plan - Industrial Visibility Stabilization

The system is currently reporting "45% Decompressing" because of a missing `file_size` field in the API response, causing the frontend to fall back to a hardcoded default. Additionally, the "Data Peeking" feature is failing because of a database search path conflict during the restoration heartbeat.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Data Peeking Logic:** I am removing the `SET search_path` command from the background heartbeat to ensure it doesn't conflict with the main system tables. I will use explicit schema references (`staging.table_name`) instead.

## Proposed Changes

---

### [Component] Backend API
#### [MODIFY] [router.py](file:///home/eisen/Downloads/SQAuto/apps/api/router.py)
- Update `job_detail` endpoint to include `file_size` in the returned JSON.
- Ensure the `profile` object is always structured correctly for the frontend.

